		{
			"name": "類人異變體",
			"source": "PaBTSO",
			"_copy": {
				"name": "Mutates",
				"source": "PaBTSO",
				"_mod": {
					"entries": {
						"mode": "prependArr",
						"items": {
							"type": "entries",
							"entries": [
								{
									"type": "entries",
									"entries": [
										"When the influence of the Far Realm affects Humanoids, the resulting creature might be a thing of nightmares. Multitudinous webbed wings sprout haphazardly along this mutate's body. Its skin becomes clammy and as smooth as a salamander's.",
										"Some intelligent Humanoid mutates retain their personalities from before they were exposed to the Far Realm. Some, driven by the allure of otherworldly powers, seek this transformation to become malevolent prophets and harbingers. Others find magical ways to return to their previous forms."
									]
								}
							]
						}
					},
					"images": {
						"mode": "prependArr",
						"items": {
							"type": "image",
							"href": {
								"type": "internal",
								"path": "bestiary/PaBTSO/Humanoid Mutate.webp"
							},
							"width": 730,
							"height": 1000
						}
					}
				}
			},
			"ENG_name": "Humanoid Mutate"
		},
		{
			"name": "伊阿爾諾 \"光杖\" 阿爾布雷克",
			"source": "PaBTSO",
			"entries": [
				{
					"type": "entries",
					"entries": [
						"格拉斯塔夫（Glasstaff）曾是領主聯盟的一名成員，在潘達林（Phandalin）抓住了一個為自己謀取私利的機會。他原本的任務是建立一個警察部隊，但他反而組織了一群歹徒和當地的流氓來鞏固自己在城鎮中的地位。",
						"格拉斯塔夫裝出一副文雅和禮貌的風度，稱呼他的匪徒和暴徒為\"我的好夥計們\"，並把綁架或縱火等卑鄙行為稱為\"那件不愉快的小事情\"或\"那些不幸的事件\"。他可能會稱角色們為他的\"尊貴客人\"，並表示遺憾，因為他無法為他們到訪的場合提供合適的娛樂。然而，在他文雅的外表下，格拉斯塔夫和紅標幫的其他人一樣暴力和傲慢。"
					]
				}
			],
			"images": [
				{
					"type": "image",
					"href": {
						"type": "internal",
						"path": "bestiary/PaBTSO/Iarno Glasstaff Albrek.webp"
					},
					"width": 701,
					"height": 1000
				}
			],
			"ENG_name": "Iarno \"Glasstaff\" Albrek"
		},
